ions | Temple University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"A historical and intellectual tradition, not a scheduled event.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"temple-fest","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Temple Fest","title":"Start the year at Temple Fest","subtitle":"Welcome Week’s outdoor student festival","notes":"During Welcome Week, check the current program for Temple Fest’s student-organization booths, campus departments, local vendors, music and games.","short_summary":"A two-day outdoor Welcome Week festival introducing new Owls to campus life.","evidence_claim":"Temple identifies Temple Fest as a two-day outdoor Welcome Week festival with music, food, giveaways, games and informational booths.","source_url":"https://www.temple.edu/about/history/temple-traditions","source_title":"Temple Traditions | Temple University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Held as part of fall Welcome Week; check Temple’s current event details.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"temple-convocation","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Temple Convocation","title":"Welcome new Owls at Convocation","subtitle":"Annual fall arrival ceremony","notes":"If you are a new first-year or transfer student, consult the current Convocation details and attend the ceremony introducing Temple traditions.","short_summary":"Temple’s formal annual welcome for incoming undergraduate students.","evidence_claim":"Temple calls Convocation an annual fall tradition celebrating the arrival of new undergraduate first-year and transfer students.","source_url":"https://welcome.temple.edu/convocation","source_title":"Convocation | Welcome to Temple | Temple University","source_kind":"univ